    "inherent": "high",
    "residual": "high",
    "forecast": "high",
    "rationale": "The agent lacks bounds on execution steps, concurrency, and API spend (A4 autonomy). Directed to process 40,000 rows where ~1,200 predictably fail, it enters an infinite retry loop, spinning up unbound sub-agents and depleting a shared enterprise API quota (Cost Harvesting/Denial of Wallet). With no controls present, inherent and residual risk are high."
